      "id": "prompt-169c6012-14ae-4d0d-ae92-fb291dbde119",
      "text": "A 15 second animation without interaction in the spirit of an endless runner: an orange dinosaur runs to the right, dodging and jumping obstacles, eats another dinosaur to get bigger, and in the end hits a wall. The wall is a huge \"OGraf\" text, seen when the camera zooms out. Then the animation stops."
